=== RangeList
List<Integer> xs = IntStream.range(0, 5).boxed().collect(Collectors.toList());

=== RangeList with step
List<Integer> xs = IntStream.iterate(0, i -> i < 10, i -> i + 2).boxed().collect(Collectors.toList());

=== ListFrom bytes
List<Integer> xs = IntStream.range(0, data.length).map(i -> data[i] & 0xFF).boxed().collect(Collectors.toList());

